          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo nukwo kuhwamu eby'okuhondera Daudi, yagenda kurwanisa Abafirisiti; ekiikaro eki, nukwo kukyeta omwandara ogw'okubaganizaamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
